name: Read study scopes and passes without starting or accepting work
size: 120x36
cwd: @REPO/scripts/devex/artifacts/scan-report-readiness-current-20261027/J399-attempt-1/native/20261027-155631/J399/fixture-target
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NODE_OPTIONS=--import=@REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/deny_provider_transport.mjs KUZUSHI_TEST_DENIED_FETCH_LOG=@ART/denied-fetch.jsonl
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_job_reader.py @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target .
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/open-study.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 21 completed | completed-study
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 21/21 complete | scan-study
expect: Account profile service
expect: pass 1/3
expect: pass 2/3
expect: pass 3/3
expect-not: ✓ …
ask: Can the operator distinguish the recorded scope, pass and state without long run references reducing every study label to an ellipsis?
nav-mode:
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 ▸ STUDY JOBS | focused-jobs
keys: PgDn PgDn PgDn PgDn PgDn PgDn
require-live-snap: 20 Asynchronous job worker | tail-jobs
expect: pass 3/3
expect: PgUp/PgDn jobs
keys: PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp
require-live-snap: 20 Account profile service | top-jobs
resize: 160x48
wait: 1
require-live-snap: 20 KUZUSHI | jobs-160x48
keys: PgDn PgDn
require-live-snap: 20 Asynchronous job worker | tail-160x48
expect: pass 3/3
keys: PgUp PgUp
require-live-snap: 20 Account profile | top-160x48
expect: Account profile
resize: 96x89
wait: 1
require-live-snap: 20 KUZUSHI | jobs-96x89
keys: PgDn PgDn
require-live-snap: 20 Asynchronous | tail-96x89
expect: pass 3/3
keys: PgUp PgUp
require-live-snap: 20 Account profile | top-96x89
expect: Account profile
resize: 80x24
wait: 1
require-live-snap: 20 KUZUSHI | jobs-80x24
keys: PgDn PgDn PgDn PgDn PgDn PgDn
require-live-snap: 20 rows 14-27/27 | tail-80x24
expect: pass 3/3
expect: JOBS
expect: rows
keys: PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp
require-live-snap: 20 rows 1-14/27 | top-80x24
expect: Account profile
expect: pass 1/3
resize: 60x20
wait: 1
require-live-snap: 20 KUZUSHI | jobs-60x20
keys: PgDn PgDn PgDn
require-live-snap: 20 rows 17-24/24 | tail-60x20
expect: pass 3/3
expect: rows
expect: PgUp/PgDn jobs
keys: PgUp PgUp PgUp
require-live-snap: 20 rows 1-8/24 | top-60x20
expect: Account profile
expect: pass 1/3
resize: 40x12
wait: 1
require-live-snap: 20 KUZUSHI | jobs-40x12
keys: PgDn PgDn PgDn PgDn PgDn PgDn PgDn PgDn PgDn PgDn PgDn PgDn PgDn PgDn
require-live-snap: 20 rows 40-42/42 | tail-40x12
expect: pass 3/3
expect: JOBS
expect: rows
expect: PgUp/PgDn jobs
keys: PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp PgUp
require-live-snap: 20 rows 1-3/42 | top-40x12
expect: Account profile
expect: pass 1/3
ask: Across the six sizes, do component names, pass numbers, states and reading controls remain usable, with all twenty-one fixed jobs reachable through paging?
resize: 120x36
wait: 1
require-live-snap: 20 KUZUSHI | before-exit
keys: c
require-live-snap: 25 21 completed | job-receipts
keys: Enter
keys: PgDn PgDn PgDn PgDn PgDn PgDn
require-live-snap: 20 Run: | exact-job-receipt
expect: trial-001
keys: Escape Escape
require-live-snap: 20 STUDY JOBS | returned-jobs
expect: Account profile
ask: Does the wider Jobs reader use available space well, with a compact recorded result, exact references available on demand and return preserving the same study?
keys: Escape C-c
require-exit: 10
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_job_reader.py @ART inspected
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NODE_OPTIONS=--import=@REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/deny_provider_transport.mjs KUZUSHI_TEST_DENIED_FETCH_LOG=@ART/denied-fetch.jsonl
launch: --target .
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/open-study.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 21 completed | recovered-study
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 21/21 complete | recovered-scan
expect: Account profile service
expect: pass 1/3
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_job_reader.py @ART recovered
ask: Does no-color recovery retain readable job labels and the same unresolved completed result, with no new decisions, work, allowance or model request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
